{"id":"word:hebrew:H4210","type":"word","title":"מִזְמוֹר","subtitle":"H4210 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"properly, instrumental music ; by implication, a poem set to notes","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to מִזְמוֹר (H4210) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-m.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 57 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"מִזְמוֹר (mizmôwr) means properly, instrumental music ; by implication, a poem set to notes First listed occurrence: Ps 3 1."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"מִזְמוֹר","transliteration":"mizmôwr","pronunciation":"miz-more'","strong":"H4210","lemmaId":"hebrew:H4210","partOfSpeech":"n-m","forms":["מִזְמ֥וֹר","מִזְמ֗וֹר","מִזְמֽוֹר","מִ֫זְמ֥וֹר","מִזְמ֖וֹר"],"morphs":[["HNcmsa",57]]},"definitions":{"short":"properly, instrumental music ; by implication, a poem set to notes","usage":"psalm.","full":"H4210. mizmor מִזְמוֺר noun [masculine] melody (technical designation of psalms; compare Hup Psalm, Einl. § 7, 2 De 4 on Psalm 3, Bae Psalmen, xiii ; , , loan-words, all = Psalm(s) ; on ׳מ , in relation to תהלה compare Lg Or ii. 22 f. ), always in this form; in 57 Psalm-titles: &#8212; ׳מ alone Psa 98:1 , ׳מ הַשַּׁבָּת ליום שׁיר 92:1 , ׳מ לְתוֺדָה 100:1 ; usually with person name or title; ׳מ לְדָוִד 3:1 ; 15:1 ; 23:1 ; 29:1 ; 63:1 ; 141:1 ; 143:1 , לדוד מ ׳שׁיר 108:1 , ׳מ לְהַזְכִּיר לדוד 38:1 , לדוד ׳מ הבית שִׁירחֲֿנֻכַּת 30:1 , מ ׳לדוד 24:1 ; 101:1 ; 110:1 , מ ׳לַמְנַצֵּחַ לדוד 13:1 ; 19:1 ; 20:1 ; 21:1 ; 31:1 ; 41:1 ; 51:1 ; 64:1 ; 140:1 ; ׳מ לדוד ֗֗֗ לַמְֿנַצֵּחַ 4:1 ; 5:1 ; 6:1 ; 8:1 ; 9:1 ; 12:1 ; 22:1 ; 39:1 ; 62:1 , שׁיר לדוד מ ׳לַמְֿנַצֵּחַ 65:1 , מ לדוד ׳למנצח 40:1 ; 109:1 ; 139:1 , מ לדוד ׳למנצח שׁיר 68:1 ; also simply מ ׳לַמְֿנַצֵּחַ שׁיר 67:1 , מ שׁיר ׳לַמְֿנַצֵּחַ 66:1 ; but also מ שׁיר ׳קרח לבניֿ 48:1 , מ ׳לִבְנֵיקֹֿרַח שׁיר 87:1 , הָאֶזְרָחִי לְהֵימָן לַמְֿנַצֵּחַמַ֗֗֗שְׂכִּיל מ ׳שׁיר קרח לבני 88:1 , מ ׳קרח לבניֿ לַמְֿנַצֵּחַ 47:1 ; 49:1 ; 85:1 , מ ׳למנצחל֗֗֗בניקֿרח 84:1 ; further ׳מ לְאָסָף 50:1 ; 73:1 ; 79:1 ; 82:1 , מ ׳שׁיר לאסף 83:1 , ׳לַמְֿנַצֵּחַמ֗֗֗ שׁיר לאסף 75:1 ; 76:1 , מ ׳לאסף ֗֗֗ לַמְֿנַצֵּחַ 77:1 ; 80:1 . [Summary: &#8212; ׳מ in 34 Psalms with לַמְֿנַצֵּחַ , of which 23 have לדוד also, 5 קרח לבני also, 4 לאסף , and 2 no proper name; in addition, in 13 Psalms with לדוד , 2 with קרח לבני , 5 with לאסף ; in only 3 without either proper name or title; ׳מ is preceded by שׁיר 5t., and following by שִׁיר 8t.]","rootNote":"from 2167 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"Ps 3 1","keyReferences":["Ps 3 1","Ps 4 1","Ps 5 1","Ps 6 1","Ps 8 1","Ps 9 1","Ps 12 1","Ps 13 1"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":57,"occurrences":[{"reference":"Ps 3 1","book":"Ps","chapter":3,"verse":1,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מִזְמ֥וֹר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsa"},{"reference":"Ps 4 1","book":"Ps","chapter":4,"verse":1,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מִזְמ֥וֹר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsa"},{"reference":"Ps 5 1","book":"Ps","chapter":5,"verse":1,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מִזְמ֥וֹר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsa"},{"reference":"Ps 6 1","book":"Ps","chapter":6,"verse":1,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מִזְמ֥וֹר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsa"},{"reference":"Ps 8 1","book":"Ps","chapter":8,"verse":1,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מִזְמ֥וֹר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsa"},{"reference":"Ps 9 1","book":"Ps","chapter":9,"verse":1,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מִזְמ֥וֹר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsa"},{"reference":"Ps 12 1","book":"Ps","chapter":12,"verse":1,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מִזְמ֥וֹר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsa"},{"reference":"Ps 13 1","book":"Ps","chapter":13,"verse":1,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מִזְמ֥וֹר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsa"},{"reference":"Ps 15 1","book":"Ps","chapter":15,"verse":1,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מִ